  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "Translate the following phrase into an algebraic expression: \"The product of four and a number.\"",
  "worked_solution": "If we denote our number by $x,$ then the phrase \"the product of four and a number\" can be written as $4$ times $x,$ or $4x.$",
